        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trap Golf is minigolf game with 2 different levels which all has 14 holes. So play totally 28 holes. Summer and winter themed levels all levels and holes contain diffent obstacles like stones, trees, moving objects and traps. . Take a swing at this amazing mini-golf game! Enjoy the realistic gameplay. Try to play every hole at least par score and be a master minigolfer and avoid traps. You can play alone and try to make good score or then you can play against difficult ai bots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn steam achievements by playing enought time and you can also change golf ball skin beginning of level</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2different levels. Summer and winter themed maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Totally 28 holes<br>- Par system<br>- Steam achievements<br>- Restart hole<br>- Different obstacles and traps<br>- Different golfball skins</p></li></ul>",
